Terima kasih.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:54.914
Luar biasa.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:56.616
Terima kasih.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.919
Nanti saja bernostalgianya.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.188
Silakan mulai kelasnya.

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.557
Jay, silakan duduk.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.597
Selamat mengajar.

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:20.006
Aku akan di ruang guru, jadi sisanya kuserahkan padamu.

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:21.975
Baik.

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:28.148
Mari kita mulai pelajarannya.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:18.298
kasih.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.633
Ikuti setelah saya, ya.

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:53.433
Like... like... To like... To like... Study... study... study... study... Love... love...

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.581
