Putingnya sensitif banget, ya.

00:15:20.552 --> 00:15:22.788
Putingnya terasa enak.

00:15:30.362 --> 00:15:32.932
Putingnya tegak. Sudah mulai tegang, kan?

00:15:33.766 --> 00:15:36.268
Bikin lebih tegang lagi.

00:15:47.579 --> 00:15:49.315
Punyamu bakal klimaks, nih.

00:16:13.439 --> 00:16:14.707
Kok kelihatannya sedih?

00:16:15.274 --> 00:16:16.742
Suaramu lucu banget.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:22.081
Manisnya.

00:16:22.448 --> 00:16:23.882
Istirahatin dulu punyamu.

00:16:27.386 --> 00:16:28.387
Jangan gerak sama sekali.

00:16:43.369 --> 00:16:44.370
Gila, kan?

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:45.871
Ada banyak, lho.

00:17:09.161 --> 00:17:13.966
Coba tanya, enak atau nggak.
