00:17:46.498 --> 00:17:47.499
Enak?

00:17:47.966 --> 00:17:50.769
Aku kasih lagi, ya. Nggak enak?

00:18:14.193 --> 00:18:15.260
Nggak enak?

00:18:26.071 --> 00:18:27.072
Nggak enak?

00:18:36.181 --> 00:18:39.384
