00:18:40.219 --> 00:18:50.996
Ayo, diam dulu. Nah. Gimana kalau yang ini?

00:18:54.333 --> 00:18:55.501
Kalau diginiin, enak nggak?

00:18:57.636 --> 00:18:59.371
Rasanya beda dari tadi.

00:18:59.538 --> 00:19:00.539
Gawat.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.175
Aku nggak bisa gerak lagi.

00:19:23.695 --> 00:19:29.635
