00:21:59.618 --> 00:22:00.719
Sampai basah begini.

00:22:02.087 --> 00:22:03.121
Basah kuyup, kan?

00:22:06.658 --> 00:22:07.659
Bu Ishihara.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:09.261
Barusan Ibu "keluar", kan?

00:22:11.096 --> 00:22:12.097
Iya, kan?

00:22:14.666 --> 00:22:17.302
Kalau mau "keluar", Ibu harus bilang dong.

00:22:17.869 --> 00:22:21.139
Murid-murid jadi nggak paham. Mengerti?

00:22:23.175 --> 00:22:24.176
Nggak paham.

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:26.745
Sepertinya mereka masih belum paham.

00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:28.547
Kalau begitu, semuanya, ayo gunakan ini padanya.

00:22:29.081 --> 00:22:30.082
Baik.

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:39.491
Hentikan.

00:22:44.363 --> 00:22:47.933
Tahu atau tidak, pokoknya pakai saja langsung ke sana.

00:22:48.367 --> 00:22:49.368
Hentikan.

00:22:49.968 --> 00:22:50.969
Hentikan.

00:23:09.755 --> 00:23:11.656
